{"title":"1997 PMWC Problems/Problem I1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Evaluate <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/4/c24d951f708e120ac5a708249367dc1d3285887c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$29 \\frac{27}{28} \\times 27\\frac{14}{15}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"101\" height=\"37\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/c/e5c21511a57087edcd6a1e756d87c298b221b06c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{29 \\cdot 28 + 27}{28} \\cdot \\frac{27 \\cdot 15 + 14}{15} = \\frac{839 \\cdot 419}{420} = \\frac{839(420 - 1)}{420} = 839 - \\frac{839}{420} = 837 \\tfrac{1}{420}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"603\" height=\"39\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/f/d8fb66f55e935cea2e5bf96f9544becd1e3d64d4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(30-x)(28-y)=840-28x-30y+xy$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"323\" height=\"18\" />, so for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/2/722b5946d2a253eff0afe4430f2db551ef1ed2fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=\\tfrac1{28},\\ y=\\tfrac1{15}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"115\" height=\"21\" /> the result is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/9/299b4c837a914880967d9bf3553c0339e7c06741.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$840-1-2+\\tfrac1{420}=837\\tfrac1{420}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"209\" height=\"21\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.p